# App Key/Secret come from registering an application in Webull's developer
# portal (developer.webull.com), not the regular login. I registered this
# project there as "weinsteinScreener" — Webull's naming rules don't allow
# hyphens, so that's the camelCase form of this project's name.
WEBULL_APP_KEY=
WEBULL_APP_SECRET=
WEBULL_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Sharadar, subscribed directly at sharadar.com (they also distribute
# through Nasdaq Data Link; this is the direct key, from the account
# page). On trial to answer one question: how much has survivorship bias
# been inflating every result, given Webull serves no delisted names at
# all and their Prices tier carries 15,000 delisted securities back to
# January 1998.
SHARADAR_API_KEY=

# SEC EDGAR refuses requests without a User-Agent naming a contact
# address. Used to resolve which company actually owns a ticker, since
# tickers get recycled and bars predating the current owner belong to
# somebody else. Format: "project-name name@example.com".
SEC_USER_AGENT=
